TOODDAE No-Sale License
Version 1.0

This is a custom source-available license, not an OSI-approved open-source
license. It permits business use but restricts sales and paid access.

1. Scope and copyright

"Covered Material" means the TOODDAE software, documentation, and other
material that a copyright holder makes available under this license,
including copies and modified versions of that material. "Licensor" means
each copyright holder granting rights to their Covered Material under this
license. Each copyright holder retains ownership of their contributions.
This license does not claim rights in third-party material distributed under
separate license terms or in material not provided under this license.

2. Permission

Subject to these terms, each Licensor grants you a worldwide, non-exclusive,
royalty-free copyright license to use, run, study, copy, modify, and create
derivative works of their Covered Material, and to distribute or share
original or modified copies without charging for them. These permissions
include personal use, use within a company or organization, and use in
commercial work. Earning revenue from your own work is not, by itself,
prohibited; selling the Covered Material or charging for access to it is.

3. No sale or paid access

Without a separate written authorization from the relevant copyright
holders, you must not:

(a) sell, resell, rent, lease, or license the Covered Material, including
    modified versions, in exchange for payment;
(b) provide the Covered Material's functionality to others as a paid hosted
    service, SaaS, subscription, or other service that charges for access
    to or use of that functionality; or
(c) make a copy of, access to, or use of the Covered Material conditional on
    payment for a bundle, membership, other product, or other service.

These restrictions apply whether the charge is collected directly or
through an intermediary. Describing the Covered Material as "free" does
not permit a payment requirement for obtaining or using it.

Ordinary employee compensation, revenue from business activities that
merely use the Covered Material internally, and payment for independently
created work or output are not payment for the Covered Material itself.
This clarification does not permit paid access to its functionality under
(a), (b), or (c).

4. Conditions for sharing and modification

When you distribute original or modified Covered Material, you must include
this license and preserve the applicable copyright, attribution, and
license notices. Clearly identify your modifications so recipients do not
mistake them for an official TOODDAE release. Do not impose terms that
remove the permissions granted here for the Covered Material, or purport
to authorize sales or paid access forbidden by section 3. These conditions
do not require you to publish your modifications or their source code.

5. User data, separate material, and trademarks

Your independently created notes, tasks, data, and other output do not
become Covered Material merely because you create or manage them using
TOODDAE. Separately licensed third-party material remains governed by its
own terms; this license does not override those terms. No right to use a
copyright holder's trademarks or to imply official endorsement is granted,
except as needed for truthful identification and preservation of notices.

6. Separate authorization and reserved rights

Copyright holders may use or sell their own work or grant separate written
permissions. To sell or offer paid access to material owned by multiple
copyright holders, you must obtain all permissions required for that use.
No rights beyond those expressly granted here are granted. Rights and
exceptions provided by applicable law are not limited by this license.

7. Termination

Your permissions under this license terminate automatically if you violate
its terms. To the extent permitted by law, you must then stop activities
that require those permissions. Termination does not remove any liability
for earlier violations. A Licensor may reinstate permissions in writing.

8. Disclaimer

TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, THE COVERED MATERIAL IS PROVIDED
"AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING
WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND
NONINFRINGEMENT. TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, NO LICENSOR IS
LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE COVERED
MATERIAL OR ITS USE.

9. Controlling text

This English license text controls. README explanations and translations
are summaries for convenience and do not replace or expand these terms.
